                                    "locked": false,
                                    "text": "<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">Hey there!</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">I'm Daniele D'Ambrosio, creator of <strong>Tricky Dragons.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\"><br>First off, thank you for your interest in <strong>Tricky Dragons</strong>! 🙏</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">We've been working hard to create something special a: <strong>beautiful and chaotic card game that you can learn in minutes but master over countless game nights</strong>. We can't wait to bring fun to your table!</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">We're preparing to launch Tricky Dragons on Kickstarter soon and couldn't be more excited! You'll be one of the first to know when our campaign goes live so you can take advantage of our <strong>Kickstarter discount</strong> and <strong>early bird bonuses</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">Also, if you're thinking about it, there is still time to <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"{{ RESERVATION_LINK }}\" target=\"_blank\" data-u-link-value=\"eyJuYW1lIjoid2ViIiwiYXR0cnMiOnsiaHJlZiI6Int7aHJlZn19IiwidGFyZ2V0Ijoie3t0YXJnZXR9fSJ9LCJ2YWx1ZXMiOnsiaHJlZiI6Int7IFJFU0VSVkFUSU9OX0xJTksgfX0iLCJ0YXJnZXQiOiJfYmxhbmsifX0=\">claim your exclusive mini expansion</a>&nbsp;before the campaign launches. You'll also get access to these additional perks:</p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"line-height: 19.6px;\">🔥 Exclusive Mini Expansion</li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 19.6px;\">👀 Early access to our campaign page</li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 19.6px;\">⭐ Access to the VIP ONLY facebook group</li>\n</ol>",
                                    "_languages": {},
                                    "_override": { "desktop": {} }
                                }
